%% Eraser corridor preview then terminal commit sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor User as User pointer
  participant Surface as CanvasSurface
  participant Tools as CanvasToolPort
  participant IE as InteractionEngine
  participant Cleanup as PointerToolCleanupCoordinator
  participant ReadPort as RuntimeInteractionReadAdapter (InteractionReadPort)
  participant Preview as CanvasPreviewState
  participant Frame as FrameEngine
  participant Spatial as SpatialKernel
  participant Geometry as GeometryPolicy
  participant EK as EditKernel
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant Applier as CommitApplier
  participant Selection as SelectionKernel
  participant Runtime as RuntimeRoot
  participant Resolver as required deletion resolver
  participant Diagnostics as DiagnosticsHub
  participant Signals as Public state/effects

  User->>Surface: pointer down in draw mode with eraser tool
  Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerInput finite down)
  Tools->>IE: normalized finite down sample
  IE->>IE: admit one active pointer token
  IE->>IE: read finite eraserThickness and start eraser session
  Note over IE: Session stores pointer token, sessionId, eraserThickness, and corridor points in world coordinates.
  IE->>ReadPort: eraserPreviewFacts(one immutable initial corridor point, eraser thickness)
  ReadPort->>Spatial: query initial preview corridor envelope
  Spatial-->>ReadPort: initial preview facts
  ReadPort->>Geometry: initial preview exact checks under the preview budget
  Geometry-->>ReadPort: initial preview facts
  ReadPort-->>IE: initial immutable preview facts
  IE->>Preview: publish CanvasEraserPreview(corridor, thickness) with first corridor point
  Preview-->>Runtime: preview revision fact
  Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
  Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint only
  Frame->>Preview: capture previewRevision and CanvasEraserPreview.corridor once
  Frame->>Frame: build immutable eraser corridor overlay primitive
  Frame->>Signals: publish overlay repaint request
  Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay eraser corridor

  loop pointer move samples for same token
    User->>Surface: pointer move
    Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerInput finite move)
    Tools->>IE: normalized finite move sample
    alt duplicate adjacent sample
      IE-->>Tools: ignore without snapshot, preview publication, read, or geometry work
    else distinct finite sample
      IE->>IE: append corridor point; immediately resample 8001 to 4000 by floor index when needed
      IE->>IE: freeze one immutable retained corridor snapshot
      Note over IE,Geometry: Move is visual-only: no ReadPort, envelope, spatial query, candidate ordering, exact hit, or deletion projection.
      IE->>Preview: replace immutable CanvasEraserPreview(corridor, thickness)
      Preview-->>Runtime: preview revision fact
      Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
      Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint only
      Frame->>Preview: capture previewRevision and CanvasEraserPreview.corridor once
      Frame->>Frame: build immutable eraser corridor overlay primitive
      Frame->>Signals: publish overlay repaint request
      Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay eraser corridor
    end
  end

  alt stale non-terminal sample or second pointer down during active routing
    Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerInput finite move/down)
    Tools->>IE: stale token or unsupported concurrent pointer
    IE-->>Tools: ignore without preview, edit, repaint, or action
  else cancel, mode change, dispose, or invalid terminal cleanup
    User->>Surface: cancel or external interruption
    Surface->>Tools: terminal cleanup request
    Tools->>IE: cleanup active eraser session
    IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for eraser session
        Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
        IE->>Preview: apply outcome: publish CanvasNoPreview and clear eraser session
    IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
    Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint cleanup
    Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
    Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
    Frame->>Signals: publish overlay cleanup repaint request
    Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay without eraser corridor
    Note over EK,Signals: No EditKernel commit, Store mutation, spatial remove, projection eviction, main repaint, or erase action is published.
  else loadDocument prepared cleanup before install interrupts active eraser
    Surface->>Tools: prepared cleanup request from external load success before install
    Tools->>IE: cleanup active eraser session
    IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for eraser session
        Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
        IE->>Preview: apply outcome: publish CanvasNoPreview and clear eraser session
    IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
    Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint cleanup
    Frame->>Frame: defer overlay repaint to loadDocument replacement repaint scheduling
    Note over EK,Signals: No eraser EditKernel commit, eraser spatial remove, eraser projection eviction, eraser main repaint, or erase action is published.
    Note over Signals: No public eraser repaint signal is published before the successful load install boundary.
    Note over Store,Frame: The loadDocumentFromJson success Store mutation, spatial rebuild, projection eviction, and main plus overlay repaint are external load effects covered by seq_load_document_success.
  else same-token pointer up
    User->>Surface: pointer up
    Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerInput finite up)
    Tools->>IE: same-token finite terminal sample
    IE->>IE: admit terminal point if distinct; resample 8001 retained points to 4000, then freeze one immutable snapshot
    IE->>ReadPort: eraserTerminalFacts(the retained snapshot, eraser thickness)
    ReadPort->>Spatial: query terminal erase candidates(corridor envelope inflated by eraserThickness/2 + hitPadding + 4.0)
    Spatial-->>ReadPort: terminal candidate handles or typed non-candidate query outcome
    alt terminal query is invalid, stale, or spatial-budget-exceeded
      ReadPort-->>IE: terminal facts with empty entries and preserved query status
      IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for eraser no-op cleanup
        Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
        IE->>Preview: apply outcome: publish CanvasNoPreview and clear eraser session
      IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
      Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint cleanup
      Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
      Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
      Frame->>Signals: publish overlay cleanup repaint request
      Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay without eraser corridor
      Note over Spatial,Signals: Every non-candidate query outcome is cleanup/no-op only. Invalid and stale remain distinct from spatial-budget-exceeded, and none publishes partial erase, document mutation, selection mutation, spatial index mutation, projection/cache eviction, main repaint, or erase action.
    else terminal spatial candidates returned
      ReadPort->>ReadPort: resolve committed facts, admit runtime eraser kinds, and count admitted candidates
      Note over ReadPort: Disallowed facts consume neither candidate nor exact-check budget. Terminal limits are 4096 admitted candidates / 32768 exact checks.
      alt admitted candidate limit exceeded before exact checks
        ReadPort-->>IE: typed terminal budget-exceeded facts
        IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for eraser no-op cleanup
          Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
          IE->>Preview: apply outcome: publish CanvasNoPreview and clear eraser session
        IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
        Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint cleanup
        Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
        Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
        Frame->>Signals: publish overlay cleanup repaint request
        Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay without eraser corridor
        Note over ReadPort,Signals: Candidate budget exceeded is cleanup/no-op only: no Geometry call, partial erase, document mutation, selection mutation, spatial index mutation, projection/cache eviction, main repaint, or erase action.
      else admitted candidate limit available
        ReadPort->>Geometry: exact hit checks for admitted deletable non-background candidates(segment-to-family), while ReadPort counts each check first
        Geometry-->>ReadPort: hit/miss results only
        alt ReadPort exact-check limit exceeded before the next Geometry call
          ReadPort-->>IE: typed terminal budget-exceeded facts with no partial ids
          IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for eraser no-op cleanup
            Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
            IE->>Preview: apply outcome: publish CanvasNoPreview and clear eraser session
          IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
          Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint cleanup
          Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
          Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
          Frame->>Signals: publish overlay cleanup repaint request
          Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay without eraser corridor
          Note over ReadPort,Signals: Exact-check budget exceeded is cleanup/no-op only: no partial erase, document mutation, selection mutation, spatial index mutation, projection/cache eviction, main repaint, or erase action.
        else terminal exact checks complete
          ReadPort->>Store: project exact-hit ids into final deletion entries
          Store-->>ReadPort: immutable entries in committed document order
          ReadPort-->>IE: terminal facts with Store-projected deletion entries

          alt terminal deletion entries empty
          IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for eraser session
          Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
          IE->>Preview: apply outcome: publish CanvasNoPreview and clear eraser session
          IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
          Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint cleanup
          Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
          Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
          Frame->>Signals: publish overlay cleanup repaint request
          Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay without eraser corridor
          Note over Store,Signals: No touched set, committed document revision change, spatial remove, projection eviction, main repaint, or erase action is published.
          Note over Runtime,Signals: Active preview cleanup publishes only preview state.
          else terminal deletion entries non-empty
          IE->>Runtime: terminal eraser intent with Store-projected entries
          Runtime->>EK: prepare deletion-only removal and existing erase action
          alt deletion-commit preparation succeeds
          EK->>EK: validate/build AcceptedCommitDocument + CommitPlan
          EK->>Runtime: invoke configured deletion preparation seam
          Runtime->>Applier: prepareDeletion(document, plan)
          Applier->>Runtime: invoke configured selection-effect preparation callback
          Runtime->>Runtime: read current selection as needed
          Runtime->>Store: normalize selection against prepared sparse commit
          Store-->>Runtime: normalized selected ids
          Runtime->>Runtime: construct PreparedSelectionEffect and copy ids into owned backing
          Runtime-->>Applier: PreparedSelectionEffect with owned backing
          Applier->>Store: prepare sparse deletion install
          Store-->>Applier: prepared Store install
          Applier->>Applier: seal single-use prepared state
          Applier-->>Runtime: single-use prepared deletion
          Note over EK,Applier: All deletion-specific preparation completes before the callback.
          Runtime->>Runtime: construct immutable CanvasDeletionCommitRequest and copy entry DTOs
          alt request construction or entry copy fails
            Runtime->>IE: cleanup eraser session with editFailure and publish directly
            IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for eraser failure cleanup
            Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
            IE->>Preview: apply outcome: clear eraser corridor preview
            IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
            Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
            Runtime->>Frame: deliver overlay cleanup repaint
            Runtime->>Signals: deliver preview cleanup state/effect only
            Note over Resolver,Signals: Resolver is not invoked. No Store, Selection, timestamp, action, or diagnostic mutation occurs.
            Runtime-->>Tools: synchronously rethrow original request-preparation error through handlePointer
            Tools-->>Surface: propagate original error to the public caller
          else request constructed
            Runtime->>Resolver: guarded required deletion request
            alt resolver accepts
              Resolver-->>Runtime: accept
              Note over Runtime,Store: Resolver return and the first Store install share one synchronous stack with no external callback or publication between them.
              Runtime->>Applier: consume prepared deletion once
              Applier->>Store: install prepared document
              Store-->>Applier: committed Store facts
              Applier->>Selection: transfer owned PreparedSelectionEffect backing and install
              Selection-->>Applier: committed selection facts
              Applier-->>Runtime: accepted delivery facts
              Runtime->>IE: post-success eraser cleanup, publish: false
              IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for eraser postSuccessCommit cleanup
              Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
              IE->>Preview: apply outcome: clear eraser corridor preview
              IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
              Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
              Runtime->>Spatial: apply touched removals only
              Runtime->>Frame: publish merged main repaint and overlay cleanup repaint
              Runtime->>Signals: deliver state after document, selection, and preview effects
              Runtime->>Signals: deliver existing erase action notification
              Note over Runtime,Signals: State/action delivery is post-install. Accepted Store and Selection facts remain final if delivery fails.
            else resolver cancels
              Resolver-->>Runtime: cancel
              Runtime->>Applier: discard prepared deletion
              Runtime->>IE: cleanup eraser session with resolverCancel, publish: false
              IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for eraser resolverCancel cleanup
              Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
              IE->>Preview: apply outcome: clear eraser corridor preview
              IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
              Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
              Runtime->>Frame: deliver overlay cleanup repaint
              Runtime->>Signals: deliver preview cleanup state/effect only
              Note over Store,Signals: No Store, Selection, timestamp, action, or diagnostic mutation occurs.
            else resolver guard rejects
              Resolver-->>Runtime: ResolverCallbackRejection contained as cancel (didThrow: true)
              Runtime->>Applier: discard prepared deletion
              Runtime->>IE: cleanup eraser session with resolverError, publish: false
              IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for eraser resolverError cleanup
              Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
              IE->>Preview: apply outcome: clear eraser corridor preview
              IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
              Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
              Runtime->>Frame: deliver overlay cleanup repaint
              Runtime->>Signals: deliver preview cleanup state/effect only
              Note over Store,Signals: No Store, Selection, timestamp, action, or resolver-failure diagnostic mutation occurs.
            else resolver throws ordinary object
              Resolver-->>Runtime: throw
              Runtime->>Diagnostics: record one bounded deletion-resolver failure
              Runtime->>Applier: discard prepared deletion
              Runtime->>IE: cleanup eraser session with resolverError, publish: false
              IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for eraser resolverError cleanup
              Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
              IE->>Preview: apply outcome: clear eraser corridor preview
              IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
              Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
              Runtime->>Frame: deliver overlay cleanup repaint
              Runtime->>Signals: deliver preview cleanup state/effect only
              Note over Store,Signals: No Store, Selection, timestamp, or action mutation occurs.
            end
            Note over Resolver,Diagnostics: Guard rejection is contained as cancel with didThrow=true. Only an ordinary callback error records the bounded diagnostic.
          end
        else deletion-commit preparation fails
          Note over EK,Store: The original error can arise in EditKernel validation/build, RuntimeRoot's configured preparation seam, CommitApplier preparation, or Store normalization/bind.
          Runtime->>IE: cleanup eraser session with editFailure and publish directly
          IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for eraser failure cleanup
          Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
          IE->>Preview: apply outcome: clear eraser corridor preview
          IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
          Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
          Runtime->>Frame: deliver overlay cleanup repaint
          Runtime->>Signals: deliver preview cleanup state/effect only
          Note over Resolver,Signals: Resolver is not invoked. No Store, Selection, timestamp, action, or resolver diagnostic mutation occurs.
          Runtime-->>Tools: synchronously rethrow original preparation error through handlePointer
          Tools-->>Surface: propagate original error to the public caller
          end
        end
      end
    end
  end
end
